{
  "summary": "This experiment tested switching fusion from concatenation to weighted in the top-performing multimodal configuration (scvi_n200 RNA, imagenet_vit_l image, transformer aggregation). Validation accuracy improved marginally to 0.725 (from 0.721) with a corresponding increase in F1, suggesting weighted fusion may offer incremental benefits. However, the small gain and absence of direct comparisons to other fusion strategies leave uncertainty about its significance or generalizability to alternative configurations."
}

